---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import diagram from '../assets/diagrams/colophon.svg?raw';
---

<BaseLayout title="Colophon" description="How this portfolio site is built, checked and deployed.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-content">
      <h1 class="measure text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Colophon</h1>
      <div class="measure mt-6 space-y-4">
        <p>
          This site is static HTML built with Astro and styled with Tailwind CSS on a small set of
          colour tokens. Case studies, experience and skills are plain Markdown and YAML files, so I
          can update the site without touching code. It uses Fraunces and Source Sans 3, hosted on
          the site itself, with no analytics and no cookies.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every change goes through GitHub Actions: lint, formatting, type and link checks, a build,
          and Lighthouse budgets of 95 or more. A push to <code>main</code> deploys to Cloudflare
          Pages.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="diagram mt-12" set:html={diagram} />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  code {
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
</style>
